title: Collapse of the Dornish Cabinet
subtitle: [? if saxony_leader == "Bünger": Wilhelm Bünger?][? if saxony_leader == "Hale": Max Hale?] faces a vote of no confidence.
view-if: saxony_right and year == 1930 and month >= 2
on-arrival: {!
Q.saxony_kill = 1;
let dvp_toleration_threshold = 40;
let lvp_toleration_threshold = 50;
if (Q.gold_leader == "Eikenvorst") {
    dvp_toleration_threshold += 20;
} else if (Q.gold_leader != "Eikenvorst") {
    dvp_toleration_threshold -= 10;
}
if (Q.gold_ideology != "Left") {
    dvp_toleration_threshold += 10;
} else if (Q.gold_ideology == "Left") {
    dvp_toleration_threshold -= 10;
}
if (Q.lvp_ideology != "Left") {
    lvp_toleration_threshold += 10;
} else if (Q.lvp_ideology == "Left") {
    lvp_toleration_threshold -= 10;
}
if (Q.united_left_saxony >= 50) {
    lvp_toleration_threshold -= 20;
    dvp_toleration_threshold -= 20;
}
if ((Q.gold_relation >= dvp_toleration_threshold && !Q.lvp_formed) || (Q.lvp_relation >= lvp_toleration_threshold && Q.lvp_formed)) {
    Q.toleration_possible_saxony = 1;
} else {
    Q.toleration_possible_saxony = 0;
}
if (((Q.unionist_relation >= 45 || !Q.stegerwald_path) && ((Q.gold_relation >= (dvp_toleration_threshold + 5) && !Q.lvp_formed) || (Q.lvp_relation >= (lvp_toleration_threshold + 5) && Q.lvp_formed)))) {
    Q.marcher_coalition_possible_saxony = 1;
} else {
    Q.marcher_coalition_possible_saxony = 0;
}
if ((Q.gold_relation < (dvp_toleration_threshold + 5) && !Q.lvp_formed) || (Q.lvp_relation < (lvp_toleration_threshold + 5) && Q.lvp_formed)) {
    Q.gold_toleration_threshold_fail_saxony = 1;
} else {
    Q.gold_toleration_threshold_fail_saxony = 0;
}
!}
max-visits: 1
tags: event
new-page: true

= Collapse of the Dornish Cabinet

The [+ saxony_leader +] Cabinet's days are numbered following a dispute over the Dornish Commonwealth Council delegation's support for the Young Plan, which has led to a loss of confidence from the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Traditionalists**</span>, <span style="color: #11DD11;">**SLV**</span>, and <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Royalists**</span>.

We can either exit the opposition and prop up the cabinet to avoid new elections, or maintain our role in opposition-supporting all votes of no confidences. [? if marcher_coalition_possible_saxony >= 50: While a [? if lvp_formed and stegerwald_path: Unity?][? if not lvp_formed or not stegerwald_path: Grand?] Coalition with the liberals could be an option, the strong leftist leanings of the Dornish <span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span> make such an alliance unlikely. ?]

- @united_left_saxony
- @grand_coalition_saxony: We will form a [? if lvp_formed and stegerwald_path: Unity?][? if not lvp_formed or not stegerwald_path: Grand?] Coalition!
- @no_majority_saxony

@united_left_saxony
title: We will form a United Left coalition with the <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span>.
subtitle: History will repeat itself.
view-if: left_coalition_saxony >= 50
choose-if: (collectivist_relation >= 35 and collectivist_leader == "Conciliators") or (collectivist_relation >= 55 and collectivist_leader != "Conciliators")
unavailable-subtitle: Despite having the necessary votes, we lack the necessary relations.
on-arrival: red_saxony = 1; unionist_relation -= 7; ddp_relation -= 7; gold_relation -= 7; lvp_relation -= 7; coup_progress += 5; dufour_angry += 60; vanguard_militancy += 0.08; vanguard_strength += 150; loyalist_strength += 80; warden_strength += 80; strife += 1; commons_marcher += 5; commons_collectivist += 5; disfavored_marcher += 5; burgher_marcher -= 5; guild_marcher -= 5; landed_marcher -= 5; communist_coalition += 3; collectivist_relation += 15
on-display: {!  
    var cardEl = document.createElement('div');  
    cardEl.className = "face-figure2";  

    var image = new Image();  
    image.className = "face-img";  
    image.src = "img/redthuringia.png";  

    cardEl.appendChild(image);  
